&lt;div class=&quot;s7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s6&quot;&gt;•&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s5&quot;&gt;Confidence presenting to larger audiences and hosting events with partners and end customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
