&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partners are central to how Rubrik wins in France, and this role puts you at the heart of that. As Channel Development Manager, you&#39;ll build and grow the strategic partnerships that bring Rubrik to new customers, helping our partners turn Rubrik into a pipeline engine for both resale and managed services. You&#39;ll work hand in hand with our sales teams and partner leaders, with real ownership of your focus partners and a clear view of the impact you&#39;re having.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow your focus partners: &lt;/strong&gt;own a pipeline and revenue target across a portfolio of partners, for resell and managed services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open new doors: &lt;/strong&gt;gain access to your partners’ installed base, bringing Rubrik to new logos and helping partners deploy and run it so customers see value quickly and expand across the Rubrik platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expand the offer: &lt;/strong&gt;move partners beyond backup and help them sell Rubrik across more use cases, including identity, SaaS and cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; manage and grow distribution and regional channel partners to extend market and vertical reach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activate our alliances: &lt;/strong&gt;bring joint offers with CrowdStrike, Microsoft, AWS and Pure Storage to your partners, including co-sell and marketplace motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create opportunities: &lt;/strong&gt;run account mapping and joint planning with Rubrik sales, and drive partner-sourced deals through each sales stage to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build self-sufficient partners:&lt;/strong&gt; run enablement sessions for partner sales and SE teams so they can sell and deliver Rubrik on their own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go to market together:&lt;/strong&gt; plan and run marketing campaigns with focus partners alongside our marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruit new partners: &lt;/strong&gt;identify and sign partners aligned with identity, cloud and cyber recovery demand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecast and report: &lt;/strong&gt;track pipeline, deal registrations and forecast, and report to regional channel and sales leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in a partnerships or sales role at a vendor, ideally in similar or adjacent markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of identifying, winning and developing new partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving results with partners and running channel programmes in close coordination with field sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the cyber resilience, data protection, identity, cloud&amp;nbsp; and security markets, and familiarity with competitive solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning quarterly and annual sales activity and executing coordinated marketing plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in sales and product training, including partner enablement and customer presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running sales activity with partners, identifying opportunities and closing deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence reporting metrics, forecasting and tracking partner performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort hosting events with partners and customers, and presenting to larger audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;re like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-driven, self-motivated and a strong team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured and methodical in how you run projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relationship builder with a strong reputation among partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An engaging presenter, at reseller events and in front of customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about the role, with the drive to make it your own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear communicator who brings teams together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Rubrik&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A market that matters:&lt;/strong&gt; cyber resilience is a top priority for every CIO and CISO, and Rubrik is extending beyond backup into identity and cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partners at the centre:&lt;/strong&gt; our indirect model gives channel a direct line to revenue and real accountability for results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact and visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; a role where your partners&#39; success is clearly yours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A collaborative team&lt;/strong&gt; that values ownership, good ideas and working together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
