&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; BA/BS degree in Business, HR, or related field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency in data modeling and presentation tools (Excel, Google Sheets, PowerPoint, Google Slides) with strong AI/Automation skills.&amp;nbsp; Extensive experience with Google Workspace preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
