&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, manage, and operate a high-performing resource management and capacity planning system tailored for Rubrik&#39;s Global Professional Services Organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Process Standardization &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive operational alignment across NAM, EMEA, and APAC. Move from &quot;documenting standards&quot; to actively enabling regional Consulting and Delivery leaders to own the execution and adherence to a defined global resource management process to meet the growth of our business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Efficiency &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; As a critical member of the PS Leadership team, champion process design and participate in the identification and implementation of a PSA as our System of record to eliminate manual effort and accelerate core business cycles, including capacity planning, resource forecasting, and consistent reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Integrity &amp;amp; Business Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure that operational systems feed clean, harmonized data to leadership for accurate, globally consistent decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with PS Delivery leaders, Finance, and HR leadership and our PS Leadership team to deepen cross-functional process ownership into genuine enablement of global stakeholders, ensuring resource capacity&amp;nbsp; meets projected demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sub-Contractor Ecosystem Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and lead a robust sub-contractor ecosystem, seamlessly integrating external partners as a direct extension of Rubrik&#39;s internal Consulting team to dynamically scale global capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide high-level visibility and strategic recommendations to senior executives regarding global utilization, capacity forecasts, and talent distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
