&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sub-Contractor Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct experience managing and leading a sub-contractor ecosystem as an extension of a direct Consulting/Delivery team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success in building and managing a resource management/capacity planning system and team specifically for a Global Professional Services business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant executive-level exposure, with a proven ability to present complex data, influence senior stakeholders, and drive strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational Navigability:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive cross-functional organizational experience, with a track record of successfully partnering across diverse global teams and operational boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of operational systems, business intelligence, AI, and process automation within a global services resource management/capacity planning context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s Degree in Computer Science, Business, Engineering, or a related technical field preferred; equivalent practical experience welcomed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
