&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Rubrik&#39;s Customer Success and Renewals organization is the operational backbone that keeps our retention and growth&amp;nbsp; motions running as a measurable, automated, insight-driven system. We&#39;re looking for a senior Customer Success&amp;nbsp; Operations professional to be the operational engine behind these motions — building the automation that removes manual&amp;nbsp; toil, turning scattered data into trusted analytics, and acting as the connective tissue between Customer Success, Renewals,&amp;nbsp; RevOps, Product, and Engineering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design and build automation across the customer lifecycle — onboarding, adoption tracking, renewal triggers, risk&amp;nbsp; alerts, health-score refreshes — replacing manual workflows with scalable, self-refreshing processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering to instrument customer and telemetry signals into the reporting layer, and&amp;nbsp; coordinate on closing technical/product gaps surfaced by CS and Renewals data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build and own CS/Renewals dashboards and executive data packs covering GRR/NRR, renewal trends, churn/downsell drivers, at-risk accounts, health distribution, adoption, and time-to-value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Design and govern product metrics across product/eng and post sales teams; own data integrity across&amp;nbsp; Salesforce, the CS platform, Snowflake, and Tableau.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Apply AI/LLM tools to automate reporting, build workflows and frameworks from scratch, accelerate analysis, and reduce manual operational work — and help set&amp;nbsp; the standard for how the post-sales org uses AI to scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Act as the operational bridge across RevOps, Sales Ops, Finance, Support Ops, Enablement, and Data/BI — leading&amp;nbsp; cross-functional programs and driving alignment on data, definitions, and scaling initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver ad hoc and recurring analysis that turns raw data into decision-ready insight for CS and Renewals leadership.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
