&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 6 years in Customer Success Operations, Revenue Operations, Sales Ops, or a CS/analytics function in B2B SaaS or enterprise technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, or a related technical field preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excel skills, plus fluency in SQL, Tableau, and Snowflake — able to independently build dashboards, + skills and frameworks/apps or agents, define metrics, and derive insight from complex, multi-source data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience designing and building automations: workflow automation, triggered actions, CS-platform&amp;nbsp; configuration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience applying AI/LLM tools to automate reporting, analysis, or operational workflows. Deep familiarity with Salesforce and a Customer Success platform (Gainsight, Totango, Planhat, or similar).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Fluency in core post-sales metrics — GRR, NRR, churn, downsell, health scoring, segmentation, renewal motions —&amp;nbsp; and judgment on which ones drive decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong technical/product reasoning, program-management ability, and a track record presenting metrics and insight to&amp;nbsp; senior leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
