&lt;p&gt;Skills and Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education:CA Intern and eligible for industrial training, Graduate or post-graduate degree in Finance (BCom, MCom, MBA) or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills:
