&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Professional Services Sales Manager, you will use your technical and sales expertise to lead Rubrik’s pre-sales Service engagements to scope, propose, and close Professional Services alongside the core Rubrik platform. You&#39;ll be a critical partner in helping Account Executives and Sales Engineers close deals by giving customers the confidence they will achieve their goals after the sale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Expertise in Change Management and Transformation — People, Process, and Technology — is critical to crafting services work streams aligned to each customer&#39;s long-term strategy. You&#39;ll lead scoping calls and Path-to-Production workshops, size services investment, and partner closely with Sales, Professional Services delivery, and Resilience Guardian teams throughout the customer lifecycle. As Rubrik scales AI-enhanced tools into the services sales motion — pipeline management, forecasting, quote automation, project scoping, SOW generation —&amp;nbsp; you&#39;ll have the opportunity to help shape that evolution and grow your career alongside it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead the pre-sales process for complex opportunities — understanding customer business and technical objectives, scoping engagements, and building the services business case&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Account Executives and Sales Engineers to position Professional Services and Advanced Services offerings, methodology, and value — helping them close bigger deals faster and exceed quota&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build proposals, quotes, and SOWs, increasingly leveraging AI-enhanced workflows to accelerate turnaround&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work closely with Professional Services delivery, Support, and Resilience Guardian stakeholders to align pre-sales scope with post-sales success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own and drive services pipeline, forecasting, and bookings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver on-site and remote scoping calls and Path-to-Production workshops with Professional Services Specialists&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to travel up to 10% of the time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
