&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of technical and sales experience, ideally in Professional Services or solution selling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data protection, cloud, cyber resilience, and security conceptual and industry knowledge is a must&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
