&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a strong leader for ANZ region, who will build on one of the existing Enterprise teams and lead the organization forward to achieve further goals and successes. Based in Sydney, you will play a crucial role in building an inclusive and highly motivated team across ANZ &amp;amp; to capitalize on the market opportunity and springboard your career to the next stage of success.&lt;/p&gt;
