&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading a team of Enterprise Sales Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating and executing on a plan to hit targets and exceed them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving a culture of pipeline generation via personal pg, channel and SDRs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching team members on customer calls, providing feedback and adding value to those conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in the wider sales leaderships enablement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and retain the partner ecosystem and work closely with focused partners to foster collaboration and opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in strategic and tactical planning for the region and a key member of the APJ Management team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive accurate team forecasting practice in line with management expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct weekly progress meetings with the sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Required Skills&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands &amp;amp; uses MEDDPICC as a sales qualification tool as well as Command of the message.&lt;/li&gt;
