&lt;li&gt;Ideally a min 10+ years as an individual contributor in SaaS Subscription sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally have relevant domain experience across backup, cloud, datacenter &amp;amp; security / SaaS environments or a technical sales background.&lt;/li&gt;
