&lt;li&gt;Desire for a successful career in sales/business development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Written &amp;amp; Verbal Communication succinct &amp;amp; professional email, LinkedIn, phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What would make you successful in this role?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity, grit, goal-oriented, growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation &amp;amp; Time Management &lt;/strong&gt;ability to structure hours/days/weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research &amp;amp; Business Intuition&lt;/strong&gt; ability to interpret information and use for prospecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active Listening &amp;amp; Adaptability&lt;/strong&gt; audible ready to carry conversation and react with value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objection Handling &lt;/strong&gt;ability to comprehend and overcome objections&lt;/li&gt;
