&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_94cc2b54076ac6c6&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color tutor-markdown-rendering&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik has partnered with the world&#39;s leading Global Systems Integrators (GSIs) to build successful, profitable outcomes for our joint customers and both companies. The GSI Account Executive will own and scale Rubrik&#39;s partnership with two named GSI partners — Cognizant and TCS — driving pipeline, bookings, and co-sell motion across their respective practices in the &lt;strong&gt;Americas&lt;/strong&gt;. This is a senior, quota-influencing role for someone with a proven track record managing Global GSI partnerships, spanning business development, partner enablement, cost/commercial models, financial selling, and executive-level negotiation. This person leads from the front, communicates with transparency, and sets the tone for a positive, collaborative field-and-partner working relationship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary Rubrik owner of the Cognizant relationship, aligning to their Cloud, Infrastructure Services, Cybersecurity and AI &amp;amp; Digital Engineering Practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary Rubrik owner of Cognizant and TCS GTM working closely with the Global Account Manager,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute the vision of the Global business plan with a Geo lens with each partner covering GTM priorities, enablement milestones, marketing commitments, and bookings targets, refreshed quarterly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map and maintain executive relationship coverage across both partners — alliance leads, practice GMs, and delivery leadership — and Rubrik&#39;s aligned sales, SE, and executive sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and run senior GSI meetings with key Cognizant and TCS business executives from day one, including QBRs and executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the main conduit between the Rubrik field and both GSI partners for new logo generation, pipeline creation, and joint business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline through structured co-sell motions, campaign execution, and account mapping with each partner&#39;s sales organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate Cognizant&#39;s and TCS&#39;s technical and commercial adoption of Rubrik&#39;s product portfolio, tracking practice certifications, demo capability, and delivery readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent and present Rubrik&#39;s and each partner&#39;s joint value proposition to customers, partner sellers, and partner leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify each partner&#39;s top/strategic customer accounts and execute interlock with the Rubrik sales organization for opportunity registration, deal support, and account planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and validate each partner&#39;s sales process and path to contract closure (procurement, legal, partner commercial approvals) to support accurate joint forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a positive, coordinated ecosystem across adjacent OEMs and ISVs relevant to Cognizant and TCS engagements, including HP, Everpure, Microsoft, and AWS, avoiding channel conflict and reinforcing joint solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the partner cost model and financial selling motion — incentive structures, resale/referral economics, and deal registration benefits — to make Rubrik the economically preferred choice within each partner&#39;s portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and enable Rubrik account teams on how to work each partner&#39;s org, escalation paths, and win themes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on partner pipeline, bookings, enablement, and program health on a regular cadence to Rubrik and partner leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Capabilities &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful, verifiable track record partnering directly with Cognizant and/or TCS, or comparably-sized GSIs, at a national or global level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to set up and run GSI meetings with key business executives from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading from the front as the main conduit for new logo generation, pipeline creation, and business development between a vendor field org and GSI partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate and accelerate a large partner organization&#39;s adoption of product solutions and translate that into bookings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence; able to represent and present Rubrik&#39;s and a partner&#39;s joint value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exemplary relationship-building skills, with a proven ability to build lasting, mutually valuable relationships with GSI partners and internal sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying a GSI&#39;s top customers and executing interlock with a vendor sales org for opportunity registration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and validating a partner&#39;s sales process and path to contract closure for accurate forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a positive ecosystem with OEMs and ISVs (e.g., Everpure, Microsoft, AWS, and others).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with commercial/cost modeling, incentive design, and financial selling in a partner context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel 50%+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
