&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager, Identity Resilience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Bangalore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Identity Resilience&lt;/strong&gt; team is Rubrik&#39;s fastest-growing business line, laser-focused on solving the most critical identity security challenges facing enterprises today. We operate as an entrepreneurial, &quot;0-to-1&quot; portfolio within Rubrik.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a product organization, we empower PMs to be central leaders who own the entire lifecycle - from board-level strategic vision to deep technical execution. On this team, you won’t just manage a backlog; you will be in the room with Fortune 500 CISOs, guiding engineering through complex architectural trade-offs, and architecting the macro go-to-market strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager for Identity Resilience&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the strategic anchor and execution engine for Rubrik&#39;s Identity Protection portfolio. You will define how enterprises secure, audit, and rapidly recover their crown-jewel identity infrastructure (e.g., Active Directory, Entra ID, Okta, Ping, etc).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-visibility, high-leverage role. You will partner deeply with Engineering, Design, and Go-To-Market (GTM) leadership to transform a rapidly evolving domain into a market-leading, multi-million dollar business line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Strategy &amp;amp; Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and evolve the multi-year product roadmap for enterprise identity protection, aligning technical capability with Rubrik&#39;s broader data security platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0-to-1 Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the definition, design, and launch of next-generation features for workforce and customer identity platforms, driving products from early discovery to mainstream market adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Principal Engineers and Architects to navigate complex technical trade-offs in scale, security, and cloud/on-prem hybrid topologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Market Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted advisor to enterprise CISOs and IT executives, distilling complex customer pain points, compliance frameworks, and active threat vectors into crisp product requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Enable global sales, marketing, and customer success teams on product positioning, pricing, and competitive differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-First Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion AI-native product development, leveraging agentic workflows and LLMs to radically accelerate product research, user experience, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Define, track, and optimize north-star metrics for product adoption, operational reliability, and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years of experience in Product Management for B2B enterprise software, preferably with products in cybersecurity, identity management (IAM, PAM, IGA) or cloud infrastructure space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complexity Handling:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of navigating extreme ambiguity, distilling highly complex, unstructured system architectures into clear, phased product milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0-to-1 Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success taking enterprise security products from initial concept (&quot;0-to-1&quot;) to validated product-market fit and commercial scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional stakeholder management skills with a proven ability to influence cross-functional director-level peers without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Face-Time:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong pre- and post-sales customer-facing experience, comfortable leading technical deep-dives with enterprise security buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based out of our &lt;strong&gt;Bengaluru&lt;/strong&gt; office, with an appetite for working in a high-energy hybrid environment and collaborating effectively with global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Impact, High Visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape the anchor growth engine of a premier data security company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;World-Class Talent:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with industry-defining leaders, engineers, and designers who are rewriting the rules of cyber resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Benefit from a flat hierarchy that rewards bold bets, rapid iteration, and intellectual honesty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
