&lt;p data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;171&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;171&quot; data-end=&quot;174&quot;&gt;Are you ready to shape the future of tech hiring at Rubrik? We are seeking a passionate Senior Talent Partner to drive the growth and expansion of our Sales and GTM teams across APJ. This is a pivotal moment to join our journey as we continue scaling high-performing teams and redefining the data security and management space with our industry-leading Zero Trust Data Security™ platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;578&quot; data-end=&quot;1084&quot;&gt;As a Senior Talent Partner at Rubrik, you’ll be more than a recruiter—you’ll be a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;strategic partner and innovator, collaborating with leadership and hiring managers to identify, attract, and secure exceptional talent. You will have the autonomy to design creative sourcing strategies, engage diverse talent pools, and deliver an unparalleled candidate experience. If you thrive in a dynamic, fast-paced environment and are excited to work with a mission-driven organization, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
