&lt;li data-start=&quot;2272&quot; data-end=&quot;2338&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2274&quot; data-end=&quot;2338&quot;&gt;Tenacious, high-energy, with a sense of urgency and integrity.&lt;/p&gt;
