&lt;li data-start=&quot;2339&quot; data-end=&quot;2414&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2341&quot; data-end=&quot;2414&quot;&gt;Comfortable partnering with multiple stakeholders across APJ countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2415&quot; data-end=&quot;2466&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2417&quot; data-end=&quot;2466&quot;&gt;Japanese language skills are a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
