&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Sales &amp;amp; Marketing and Finance processes across lead lifecycle, opportunity management, forecasting, campaign management, sales performance management, commissions, and partner programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience delivering complex programs on CRM and marketing platforms (e.g., Salesforce Sales Cloud / Service Cloud, Marketo, Adobe Experience Manager, or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on proficiency with generative AI platforms (e.g., Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT) to automate project documentation, accelerate decision-making, and streamline cross-functional workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
