&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead cross-functional, global teams and manage stakeholders at multiple levels, including senior business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record establishing program governance, managing budgets, and driving projects to successful completion in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
