&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8–10+ years of direct experience in Service New Product Introduction (NPI), Services Productization, or Solution Engineering within a global SaaS, Enterprise Software, or Cyber Resilience company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Services Portfolio Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of taking complex enterprise technology services from initial concept to global field execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to influence and collaborate across matrixed organizations, particularly with Product Management, Product Engineering, and Field Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience presenting to and collaborating with executive leadership (VP level and above), with a track record of driving strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Strategic Aptitude:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of enterprise IT infrastructure, data management, cloud platforms, or cybersecurity frameworks, enabling effective technical alignment with Engineering leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
