&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly driven, go&lt;span class=&quot;citation-1123 citation-end-1123&quot;&gt;al-oriented &quot;get it done&quot; attitude.&lt;/span&gt;Experience selling complex technical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
