&lt;p&gt;We are currently hiring for 2 Sr Finance Manager roles. These roles sit at the center of a fast-scaling GTM org on an AI-native transformation journey. You&#39;ll be expected to keep pace with rapid growth, bring order to ambiguity, and continuously challenge how the finance function operates — not just run the existing playbook. Reporting to the Director of Finance, one role will own and drive the business partnering for Americas and PLS sales organizations and the other will be focused on the presales and Alliances organizations delivering RoI framework, strategic insights and other financial reporting. We are looking for an AI-native leader who treats AI as a default part of their workflow — automating recurring reporting, building self-serve analytics, and using LLM-based tools to move faster and go deeper than a traditional finance function.Their work will have high visibility and impact on senior leadership at Rubrik.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These positions will be based in Palo Alto, California and will require in-office attendance 3 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
