&lt;li&gt;Effectiveness of the Product Sales Teams across each product-line&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Partnering with Americas Sales and Global Product Sales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
