&lt;li&gt;A trusted business and analytical partner to Sales and Finance leaders — translates data into clear recommendations and influences decisions, not just reports on them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construct &amp;amp; present monthly and quarterly review of Americas Sales, Global Product Sales, and its supporting organizations to Sales and Finance Executive Leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and present the ROI frameworks for overlay Product Sales teams, build fully loaded PnLs with ecosystem costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complete headcount management for Americas Sales and Global Product Sales. Collaborate with Sales Ops and Recruiting to maintain accurate source of truth for actuals &amp;amp; forecasts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze how commission structures drive rep behavior across product lines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-assisted, automated workflows for recurring reporting, BvA, and forecasting — Architect AI-driven FP&amp;amp;A workflows and automated reporting pipelines, shifting team capacity from data aggregation to high-value strategic analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driven ambiguous projects independently; identified gaps and anticipated problems before they had a major impact on the business. Served as a subject-matter expert who defines project scope, identifies gaps (strategic vs. tactical), provides recommendations, and drives results via cross-functional collaboration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 8+ years of related experience with a Bachelor’s degree; or 6 years and a Master’s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel &amp;amp; Google Sheets skills, Demonstrated use of AI tools (e.g., LLM assistants, Claude, agents) to automate analysis, build workflows, or accelerate reporting — with the judgment to validate AI output for accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and written communication skills &amp;amp; attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a high-growth, fast-changing environment — comfortable with shifting priorities, incomplete information, and tight timelines environment to meet deadlines with efficiency and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instinct to identify broken, manual, or repetitive processes and redesign them — comfortable respectfully challenging the status quo and proposing better ways of working, even when &#39;that&#39;s how we&#39;ve always done it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It is helpful, but not required to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Adaptive Insights, NetSuite, Salesforce, Tableau, Workday, Coupa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience managing headcount and conducting BvA calls (Budget vs Actual)&lt;/li&gt;
